---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Get My Growth Plan | ScratchBox
description: Tell ScratchBox where your business is today and where it needs to go. We will identify the growth system that fits.
pageId: contact
---
<main class="growth-plan-page">
  <section class="growth-plan-hero">
    <div>
      <p class="v2-eyebrow">A focused first conversation</p>
      <h1>Let's build your <em>Growth Plan.</em></h1>
      <p>Tell us where you are today, where you want to go and what's getting in the way. We'll identify the growth system that fits.</p>
      <div class="growth-plan-trust"><span>Strategy</span><i>→</i><span>Brand</span><i>→</i><span>Content</span><i>→</i><span>Demand</span></div>
    </div>
    <aside>
      <p class="v2-eyebrow">Designed for serious growth conversations</p>
      <ul><li>One team across strategy, creative, technology and demand.</li><li>Focused projects typically start from ₹1L.</li><li>Ongoing growth partnerships typically start from ₹1.5L/month.</li></ul>
      <a href="/work/" class="v2-text-link">See the work first <span>→</span></a>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="growth-plan-form-wrap" id="growth-plan-form">
    <div class="growth-plan-form-intro"><p class="v2-eyebrow">Your growth brief</p><h2>Give us the context to make the first conversation useful.</h2><p>We use this information only to understand your business and recommend the right next step.</p></div>
    <form class="growth-plan-form" onsubmit="handleGrowthPlanSubmit(event)" novalidate>
      <input type="hidden" name="source" value="website"/>
      <input type="hidden" name="landing_page" value="/contact/"/>
      <input type="hidden" name="attribution" value=""/>
      <div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-name">Name</label><input class="form-input" id="growth-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" placeholder="Your name" required/></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-email">Work email</label><input class="form-input" id="growth-email" type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@company.com" required/></div></div>
      <div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-company">Company</label><input class="form-input" id="growth-company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" placeholder="Company name" required/></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-website">Website</label><input class="form-input" id="growth-website" type="url" name="website" placeholder="https://"/></div></div>
      <div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-role">Your role</label><select class="form-select" id="growth-role" name="role" required><option value="">Select your role</option><option>Founder</option><option>CEO</option><option>CMO</option><option>Marketing Head</option><option>Growth Head</option><option>Other</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-phone">Phone / WhatsApp</label><input class="form-input" id="growth-phone" type="tel" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" placeholder="+91 00000 00000"/></div></div>
      <div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-industry">Industry</label><select class="form-select" id="growth-industry" name="industry" required><option value="">Select an industry</option><option value="saas">SaaS / Technology</option><option value="d2c">D2C / Consumer</option><option value="healthcare">Healthcare / Wellness</option><option value="b2b">B2B</option><option value="education">Education</option><option value="real-estate">Real Estate</option><option value="hospitality">Hospitality</option><option value="growing-business">Growing business</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-objective">What are you trying to achieve?</label><select class="form-select" id="growth-objective" name="objective" required><option value="">Select an objective</option><option value="brand-engine">Build a brand</option><option value="launch-engine">Launch a product</option><option value="growth-engine">Generate more demand</option><option value="content-engine">Build a content engine</option><option value="scale-partnership">Scale marketing</option><option value="brand-engine">Reposition the business</option><option value="other">Other</option></select></div></div>
      <div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-revenue">Current annual revenue</label><select class="form-select" id="growth-revenue" name="annual_revenue" required><option value="">Select a range</option><option value="pre-revenue">Pre-revenue</option><option value="under-1cr">Under ₹1Cr</option><option value="1-5cr">₹1–5Cr</option><option value="5-25cr">₹5–25Cr</option><option value="25-100cr">₹25–100Cr</option><option value="100cr-plus">₹100Cr+</option><option value="prefer-not-to-say">Prefer not to say</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-timeline">Timeline</label><select class="form-select" id="growth-timeline" name="timeline" required><option value="">Select a timeline</option><option value="immediately">Immediately</option><option value="within-30-days">Within 30 days</option><option value="1-3-months">1–3 months</option><option value="3-6-months">3–6 months</option><option value="exploring">Exploring</option></select></div></div>
      <div class="form-row"><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-project-budget">Project investment</label><select class="form-select" id="growth-project-budget" name="project_budget"><option value="">Not applicable / not sure</option><option value="1-3l">₹1–3L</option><option value="3-5l">₹3–5L</option><option value="5-10l">₹5–10L</option><option value="10l-plus">₹10L+</option><option value="not-sure">Not sure</option></select></div><div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-retainer-budget">Monthly partnership investment</label><select class="form-select" id="growth-retainer-budget" name="retainer_budget"><option value="">Not applicable / not sure</option><option value="1-2l">₹1–2L/month</option><option value="2-3l">₹2–3L/month</option><option value="3-5l">₹3–5L/month</option><option value="5l-plus">₹5L+/month</option><option value="not-sure">Not sure</option></select></div></div>
      <div class="form-group"><label class="form-label" for="growth-message">What is getting in the way?</label><textarea class="form-textarea" id="growth-message" name="message" placeholder="Tell us about your goals, constraints and what a strong outcome would look like."></textarea></div>
      <button class="form-submit" type="submit">Get My Growth Plan <span class="arr">↗</span></button><p class="growth-plan-privacy">Your information is private and used only to respond to this enquiry.</p><p class="growth-plan-status" aria-live="polite"></p>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section class="growth-plan-next"><p class="v2-eyebrow">What happens next</p><div><article><span>01</span><h2>We review the context.</h2></article><article><span>02</span><h2>We identify the most relevant growth system.</h2></article><article><span>03</span><h2>We decide if there is a strong fit to work together.</h2></article></div></section>
</main>
{% include "partials/footer.njk" %}
